## 🧠 Think Like This

Imagine handing your Admission Form

DIRECTLY to the Records Clerk standing right there,

instead of mailing it to a separate office across town

and waiting for a response back.

Server Actions let the FORM

talk DIRECTLY to server-side logic,

no separate API route needed.

