## 🧠 Never Forget This

📋 Handing It Directly to the Clerk

No mailing to a separate office (API route) —

hand the form straight to server logic.

---

## 💼 Real Project

School ERP

```jsx
async function addStudent(formData) {
    "use server";
    const name = formData.get('name');
    await db.students.create({ name });
}

<form action={addStudent}>
    <input name="name" />
